Compute:
  Provider: AWS / GCP / Azure
  Instances: t3.medium (2 vCPU, 4GB RAM) minimum
  Auto-scaling: 2-20 instances based on CPU > 70%
  
Database:
  MongoDB Atlas M30 cluster (3 nodes)
  Redis ElastiCache (cache.t3.medium)
  Elasticsearch (t3.medium.elasticsearch)
  
CDN:
  CloudFront / Cloudflare for static assets
  S3 for file storage
  
Monitoring:
  Prometheus + Grafana (t3.medium)
  OpenTelemetry for tracing
  Sentry for error tracking
  
CI/CD:
  GitHub Actions → Build Docker image
  ArgoCD → Deploy to Kubernetes
  Blue/Green deployment strategy
  
Backup:
  MongoDB: Daily snapshots (retained 30 days)
  Redis: RDB snapshots every 6 hours
  S3: Cross-region replication
